      "source_text": "是的，我带“小槙”来了～机会难得，\n我想让她一起看看赖恩姐姐大人她们的英姿嘛～",
      "source_fingerprint": "dccfac5d03abd2ab5fe9458c39810be417d277d2f0698ac4364e1bc29bd79c8d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
