      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──嗯～真是一段美好的时光呢。大家的表现都很令我自豪……\n我也好想快点正式登场，向粉丝们致意呀～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e767bd73ebde7d82e57443bc0192326fdecfcc15092f198e8c43cc2ac451773",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
